      "role": "user",
      "content": "Oh, my bad, I thought the audit logs from this morning were already synced to your workspace. \n\nLook at the entry for 'AuthCore-Lib' (v2.4.1) in the dependency manifest—it's flagging a high-severity CVE. I'm worried that might be a major issue for the auth-module. Is that something we can just patch with a workaround, or is it going to require a significant architectural overhaul? I really need to know if this is going to blow the budget and the timeline.",
